msgid "Redis"
msgstr "रेडिस"

#: internal/modules/cache/cache.go:24
msgid ""
"Redis (Remote Dictionary Server) is an in-memory, key/value store that is "
"used primarily as an application cache or quick-response database."
msgstr ""
"Redis (Remote Dictionary Server) मेमोरीमा रहने key/value भण्डार हो, जुन "
"मुख्यतः एप्लिकेसन क्यास वा छिटो प्रतिक्रिया दिने डाटाबेसको रूपमा प्रयोग "
"हुन्छ।"

#: internal/modules/cache/cache.go:27
#: internal/modules/dashboard/sections.go:131
#: internal/modules/dashboard/sections.go:252
msgid "Memcached"
msgstr "मेमक्यास्ड"

#: internal/modules/cache/cache.go:28
msgid ""
"A high-performance, distributed in-memory key-value caching system designed "
"to accelerate dynamic web applications."
msgstr ""
"गतिशील वेब एप्लिकेसनहरूलाई छिटो बनाउन डिजाइन गरिएको उच्च-प्रदर्शन, वितरित, "
"मेमोरीमा रहने key-value क्यासिङ प्रणाली।"

#: internal/modules/cache/cache.go:31
#: internal/modules/dashboard/sections.go:255
msgid "ElasticSearch"
msgstr "इलेस्टिकसर्च"

#: internal/modules/cache/cache.go:32
msgid ""
"The leading distributed, RESTful, open source search and analytics engine "
"designed for speed and reliability."
msgstr ""
"गति र भरपर्दोपनका लागि डिजाइन गरिएको अग्रणी वितरित, RESTful, खुला स्रोत खोज "
"र विश्लेषण इन्जिन।"

#: internal/modules/cache/cache.go:35
#: internal/modules/dashboard/sections.go:133
#: internal/modules/dashboard/sections.go:254
msgid "OpenSearch"
msgstr "ओपनसर्च"

#: internal/modules/cache/cache.go:36
msgid ""
"OpenSearch is an open-source, distributed search and analytics suite for "
"large volumes of data."
msgstr ""
"OpenSearch ठूलो मात्राको डाटाका लागि वितरित, खुला स्रोत खोज र विश्लेषण सुइट "
"हो।"

#: internal/modules/cache/cache.go:39
#: internal/modules/dashboard/sections.go:130
#: internal/modules/dashboard/sections.go:251
msgid "Valkey"
msgstr "Valkey"

#: internal/modules/cache/cache.go:40
msgid ""
"Valkey is an in-memory key/value store (a community-driven fork of Redis) "
"used primarily as an application cache or fast, low-latency database."
msgstr ""
"Valkey मेमोरीमा रहने key/value भण्डार हो (समुदायद्वारा विकसित Redis को "
"fork), जुन मुख्यतः एप्लिकेसन क्यास वा छिटो, कम ढिलाइ भएको डाटाबेसको रूपमा "
"प्रयोग हुन्छ।"

